			"Message": "chore(build): update Queue submodule to 1fc9cff\n\nThis updates the Queue dependency to commit 1fc9cff9e6, which brings critical improvements to asynchronous task handling in Mountain's core runtime. The Queue submodule provides foundational concurrency primitives for:\n- Managing extension host communication through Vine IPC\n- Coordinating RPC calls between Track dispatcher and Cocoon\n- Scheduling filesystem operations in River/Sun modules\n\nThis version includes optimizations for batch processing of extension events and reduced contention in AppState access patterns. The update supports Land's performance goals by enabling more efficient resource utilization during concurrent operations between Tauri backend and webview components.",
			"SHA": "f5254f464c06d3401cfbed9dba5f425ba4082ac8"
		}
